  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1401.27 Jump operator",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1401.27 “Jump operator” means the person who assists the jump master to prepare a jumper for a bungee jump and operates the lowering system.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400) #5607 eff 4-2-93, EXPIRED: 4-2-99\n\nNew. #7000, eff 5-25-99; ss by #8045, eff 2-20-04; ss by #10131, eff 5-18-12; ss by #11151, eff 8-11-16; renumbered by #13535, INTERIM (formerly Saf-C 1401.18); ss by #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (formerly Saf-C 1401.23) (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
